    "text": "I, Kanapathipillai Cathiravelpillai Logeswaran, the Governor of the Western Province, in accrodance with the powersvested in me by Paragraph 8(a) in clause 154\u201cb\u201d of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka dohereby summon the Western Province Provincial Council to meet on 31st December 2015 at 9.30 a. m. in order toreconsider the Appropriation Statute No. 04 of 2015 for the Financial Statement for the year 2016 in the Council Chamberof the Provincial Council Building Complex situated at No. 204, Denzil Kobbekaduwa Mawatha, Battaramulla.",
